{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9Ib25nLUtvbmctTW92aWVzL0RlYWxlciUyMEhlYWxlciUyMCUyODIwMTclMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Dealer Healer","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/g70mZhcWEfIuAKONcfgjRN92ma1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AvTm7UMYgozsz6haA2EVevKDh3s.jpg","description":"The movie is based on a true story about a repented gangster preaching the word of God and guiding his brotherhood to turn over a new leaf.  Chen once was the leader of the famous gang \"The 13 Tsz Wan Shan\", he lost his family, lovers, brothers and finally ended up imprisoned for his drug abuse and trafficking. After jail, he devoted himself to save the lost fellows and was selected as \"The JCI Hong Kong Ten Outstanding Young Persons\".  Being respected by the world, Chen is always asked to solve the most difficult situations between evil and good. People give him a nickname \"The Fixer\". However, there are two sides of a coin, Chen can work out any problem of others, but he does not know how to deal with his personal knot with his love, with whom he has had guilty conscience all his life.  Can he fix it eventually?\n\nReleased 18 May 2017 · China, Hong Kong · 101 min","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Action","Crime","Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"101 min","cast":["Lau Ching-wan","Gordon Lam Ka-tung","Jiang Yiyan","Louis Koo","Max Zhang","Richard Ng Man-tat","Patrick Tam Yiu-man","Lo Hoi-pang"],"director":["Lawrence Ah Mon"],"released":"2017-05-18T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Lawrence Ah Mon","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tz66iTJyva30OSt5BeUV0g98YHF.jpg"},{"name":"Lau Ching-wan","character":"Chen Hua","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ecxJyPA6EPDG2AXomVJORaN4qLZ.jpg"},{"name":"Gordon Lam Ka-tung","character":"Bullhorn","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1IbIMJ4vfUgzlkiJcufNCyMWqSh.jpg"},{"name":"Jiang Yiyan","character":"Carol","ph